          "text": "```java\n/**\n * Test case for\n * <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/COMPRESS-93\">COMPRESS-93</a>.\n */\n@Test\npublic void testCompressionMethod() throws Exception {\n    final ZipArchiveEntry entry = new ZipArchiveEntry(\"test.txt\");\n    assertEquals(\"Compression method should initially be unknown\",\n            -1, entry.getMethod());\n\n    entry.setMethod(ZipEntry.STORED);\n    assertEquals(ZipEntry.STORED, entry.getMethod());\n\n    entry.setMethod(ZipEntry.DEFLATED);\n    assertEquals(ZipEntry.DEFLATED, entry.getMethod());\n\n    // Unlike java.util.zip.ZipEntry, support methods other than STORED/DEFLATED.\n    final int implodingMethod = 6;\n    entry.setMethod(implodingMethod);\n    assertEquals(implodingMethod, entry.getMethod());\n\n    final ZipArchiveEntry copy = new ZipArchiveEntry(entry);\n    assertEquals(\"Copy constructor should preserve the compression method\",\n            implodingMethod, copy.getMethod());\n\n    try {\n        entry.setMethod(-1);\n        fail(\"Negative compression methods must be rejected\");\n    } catch (final IllegalArgumentException expected) {\n        // Expected.\n    }\n}\n```"
        }
